Error [jet.BlockAfterCall]: Trailing blocks are gone — pass code with `() ->`
  --> tests/ui/trailing_block_button.jet:6:29
    |
  6 |     node: ui.button("Save") {
    |                             ^
 Why: A bare `{ }` after a call used to fill one last zero-parameter function argument; that sugar is retired
 Fix: Write `ui.button(…, () -> { … })` — put the block inside the parentheses as `() -> { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0335
